{
  "_comment": [
    "Claude Code MCP config. Copy to .mcp.json in the repo you want the agent",
    "to have memory for, and replace <YOUR_TOKEN> with your personal token.",
    "",
    "The real .mcp.json is gitignored because it holds a live credential --",
    "this .example is the shareable copy. Equivalently, skip the file and run:",
    "  claude mcp add --transport http knowledge-graph <url> \\",
    "    --header \"Authorization: Bearer kgt_...\"",
    "",
    "Do NOT use a ${KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH_TOKEN} placeholder here. Expansion resolves",
    "against the environment Claude Code was launched in, so it silently fails",
    "with a 401 when the app is started from Spotlight or the Dock. See",
    "docs/repo-setup.md.",
    "",
    "Never put the Supabase service role key here -- it is not needed and",
    "stays server-side in the Edge Function."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "knowledge-graph": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://litdbmyvvqrbpocohlpw.supabase.co/functions/v1/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <YOUR_TOKEN>"
      }
    }
  }
}
